    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mon3tr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_057"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaahh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What are you doing?!",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_057"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-you, your... what... is... mmng...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$batmeeting_intro",
        "key": "$batmeeting_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 30,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...never thought I'd see a day when Mon3tr was after me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The blade pressed against your throat has an incision angle of only eight degrees. Another six millimeters deeper and it severs an artery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, err...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did he truly work so hard to ensure your survival, as he claimed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you asking... What are you getting at?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did he and his Reunion element, or any part thereof, threaten your life or take any action to harm you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will deal with him in accordance with your response.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you threatening me with his life?! I... we... we had nothing to do with each other!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about him, individually? Did he go along with Reunion and their crimes against humanity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... Kal'tsit... I'm insulted!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can only rely on the words of eyewitnesses and victims. Since you claim to have guaranteed her right to life, then I have only the young lady's testimony by which to adjudicate your claim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You gave only your side of the story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But what she says is also\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's in a different position.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have power. You can use violence. It doesn't matter what you did with that violence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "I felt it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, it's the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "The targets are getting close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Couldn't... but he...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did he or did he not protect you from Reunion? Did he or did he not effectively keep you safe from their aggression?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...! The patrol is here! It's not... it's not the guerrillas! You can't... Don't let them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not making any sense!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I am confident our actions are well within the ethical parameters of Ursus. It was you who made the accusation against him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He... he did go out regularly, about this time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! Let me... stop the Sarkaz! Or at least... let me get them to go someplace else!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I need an answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speak. Or we will never know the truth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty-four meters out, in a straight line. Very close.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Twenty-two meters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mon3tr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_059",
        "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_057",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No! He didn't! He didn't do anything wrong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least... at least nothing I saw!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Huh?;......;You put on a good show.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Darn it... Dr. Kal'tsit! I knew it...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our next target is Reunion's Sarkaz patrol team!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm coming too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Guard, was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're wrong about me. But I'll protect you. I'll get your revenge for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll pay for what they did to you, and my family, and the common people. They'll all pay, for all of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
